    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>User Guide (on this computer)</label><div><h5>Overview (on this computer)</h5><ul><li>Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news. (on this computer)</li><li>All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage). (on this computer)</li></ul><h5>Shortcuts (on this computer)</h5><ul><li>Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette (on this computer)</li><li>1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing) (on this computer)</li><li>/ : focus search (also via palette) (on this computer)</li><li>Enter in search: start search (on this computer)</li><li>ESC: close modals (on this computer)</li><li>Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites (on this computer)</li><li>Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock (on this computer)</li></ul><h5>Search & Autocomplete (on this computer)</h5><ul><li>Bangs:  (on this computer)!g  (on this computer)!ddg  (on this computer)!bing  (on this computer)!yt  (on this computer)!wiki  (on this computer)!maps</li><li>Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings;  (on this computer){q} as placeholder (on this computer)</li><li>Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset) (on this computer)</li><li>Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search (on this computer)</li></ul><h5>Tiles (on this computer)</h5><ul><li>Drag & drop to sort, click to open (on this computer)</li><li>+ Tile: add a new favorite (on this computer)</li><li>Reset: restore default favorites (on this computer)</li></ul><h5>Widgets & Layout (on this computer)</h5><ul><li>Visibility per widget (on this computer)</li><li>Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal) (on this computer)</li><li>Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults (on this computer)</li><li>Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card (on this computer)</li></ul><h5>Background (on this computer)</h5><ul><li>Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval) (on this computer)</li><li>Accent color is extracted from the active background (on this computer)</li></ul><h5>Data (on this computer)</h5><ul><li>Export/Import as JSON (on this computer)</li><li>Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo) (on this computer)</li></ul><h5>Startpage Agent</h5><ul><li>Integrated AI chat with local Ollama (host/model in settings).</li><li>Supports streaming responses, stop (button/ESC), persistent history, and Markdown.</li><li>Agentic tools can read/change widgets and settings (depending on confirm mode).</li></ul></div></div>",
